%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NatsukiWorksOnHerDragonDripAndGetsAVisit
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320602
    - rid: 8164893214562320603
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I''ve decided: I''d like for Torvar to start earning his keep.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320604
    - rid: 8164893214562320605
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure, let's see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320606
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Ah! Here''s something he should be able to handle:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320607
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Over in Eastmarch, there's been reports of a necromancer raising dead
      and generally being annoying.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320608
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Someone's paid us to go put 'em down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: They were last seen by the Atronach Stone-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320610
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wherever that is...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Raising just some basic skeletons.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320612
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: A necromancer, eh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320613
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I've never understood why some folks can't just let the dead lie.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: The why doesn't really matter to us, just so long as it's stopped.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320614
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Since we don't <i>really</i> know how capable the necromancer is, you
      think we should send him with a Shield-Sibling?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320615
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... sure?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320616
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, in that case, make sure to send somebody with him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320617
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Understood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas goes to give Torvar his job, and to find a suitable Shield-Sibling
      for the task.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320619
    - rid: 8164893214562320620
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, with him dealt with, that <i>should</i> be everybody that needed
      something from me.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320621
    - rid: 8164893214562320626
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Forge time!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320622
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320623
    - rid: 8164893214562320624
    - rid: 8164893214562320625
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '''Sup, Eorlund.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320627
    - rid: 8164893214562320628
    - rid: 8164893214562320629
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, apprentice.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320630
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I can see that the dragon scales have already been prepared for us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: In that case, let's begin right away; we might be able to finish by the
      end of the day depending on how this goes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure thing, forgemaster.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund places three books by the forge, close to the grindstone.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320631
    - rid: 8164893214562320632
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Something to pass the time, Eorlund?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320633
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: No, since I've never worked with dragon scale before, I figured I'd consult
      the wisdom of the past before I even raise my hammer for the first swing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320634
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And you were <i>able</i> to find books about forging dragon scale?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320635
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I've skimmed all three of these books; they definitely make mention of
      dragon scale armor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320636
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's see here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund opens one of the books and starts rapidly flipping through until
      he finds a page that mentions dragon scale.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Partially because she wants something to do, and partially because she's
      curious, Natsuki picks up one of the other books and starts reading...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320637
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Reading... reading... reading...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893234914656312
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you learn anything important?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893234914656313
    - rid: 8164893234914656314
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Woah!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Other than this book being mostly ruined?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893234914656315
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Not much.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893234914656316
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, it did say that 450 "angaids" of dragon scale are apparently enough
      for a full set of armor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893234914656317
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever that means.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893234914656318
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, so around 75 pounds of scale, then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893234914656319
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Better than nothing, I suppose.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Since they had more scales than necessary, Eorlund decided to test one
      at various temperatures in the forge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172416
    - rid: 8164893266474172417
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: He was able to find a temperature at which the scales become malleable
      enough to be hammered, but not so hot they begin to burn or melt.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, so dragon scale is best struck after smelting at Fourth-Coal...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172419
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Fourth-Coal, Eolund?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172420
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: If you'd recall, apprentice, the forge's coal stage is a way of describing
      how hot it is.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172421
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: To reach Fourth-Coal, you need four measures of kindlings to be placed
      within the forge- properly aerated, of course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh yeah, right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172422
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, we'll definitely be weaving these scales like a tradition scalemail-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172423
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Which means we'll need some sort of metal to bind the scales to; to maintain
      the structure of an armor piece.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think we could use some of these bone-y pieces as a binding?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172424
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm... Probably, and since they came from a dragon they'd probably be
      stronger than most metals-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172425
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: But, we wouldn't be able to shape them ourselves; it's for the best that
      we get a secondary metal to work with.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So... just steel or something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye. That'd work.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172428
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Alright then, apprentice. First, we''re going to sort through the more
      skeletal scales, see what we can work with. '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172429
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Once we've figured that out, we'll start forging the framing pieces of
      steel- we're trying to work it around the skeletal pieces.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Finally, we'll begin the process of heating, hammering, and then weaving
      the scales into a mail that will be strung between the frame.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Understood?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Heck yeah. Let's get to work.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893266474172430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Eorlund and Natsuki were able to quickly separate the more skeletal scales
      from the rest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151296
    - rid: 8164893287844151297
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They are now working on the frame pieces of Natsuki's armor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Apprentice, you'll need to reheat that piece, the gap for the scale is
      too large.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Grr...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151299
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki walks over to the forge, placing her piece inside the heat.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151301
    - rid: 8164893287844151304
    - rid: 8164893287844151303
    - rid: 8164893287844151305
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>What</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151306
    - rid: 8164893287844151307
    - rid: 8164893287844151308
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uuuhh... I'm sorry for interrupting...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151309
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh, Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151310
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151311
    - rid: 8164893287844151312
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What're ya doing here, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151313
    - rid: 8164893287844151314
    - rid: 8164893287844151315
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah. Do you remember how I learned a method of teleportation spell?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151316
    - rid: 8164893287844151317
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh. Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151318
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I've managed to enchant a curio to contain that teleport spell.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151319
    - rid: 8164893287844151320
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151321
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: This means I can have multiple different recall points-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>And</i> I should be able to share these curios with multiple people,
      giving them the power to teleport too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151323
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I was planning on enchanting curios for all of us so that we can
      warp to important locations.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151324
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's great and all Yuri, but if you need my help for that you'll have
      to wait.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151325
    - rid: 8164893287844151326
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: As you can see-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151327
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki takes out the frame piece she was working on from the forge and
      gives it a wack to make sure it's warm enough.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm busy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151328
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah... so you are...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, it doesn't really matter what sort of curio I'm enchanting the
      spell into-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151330
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: So, the only thing I'd need help with is getting the soul gems needed
      to enchant them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151331
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Which I doubt you'd have many of on hand...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151332
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I was just planning on taking a break to do some recreational reading
      around here until the rest of the club is back.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151333
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I know what {mc} and Sayori are up to; do you know if Monika's gonna
      be back here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151334
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{Player} said she''d probably come back here after finishing up her
      business in Falkreath.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151335
    - rid: 8164893287844151336
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh. Neat.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151337
    - rid: 8164893287844151338
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well you can hang around Jorrvaskr while you wait; I've got a pretty
      full bookshelf in my room downstairs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151339
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Just try not to do anything magical while you're in there, you'd probably
      get bullied for it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151340
    - rid: 8164893287844151341
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I... see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151343
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: In any case, thank you for your hospitality, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151342
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Best of luck with whatever you're forging.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri heads inside Jorrvaskr to read and rest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151344
    - rid: 8164893287844151345
    - rid: 8164893287844151346
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Apprentice, you need to hit that bit harder.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Grk-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151347
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151348
    - rid: 8164893287844151349
    - rid: 8164893287844151350
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'As Yuri enters Jorrvaskr, she pauses at the sight before her:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151351
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: A scene of excessively alcoholic merriment paired with a brawl in the
      corner of the room.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151352
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh my.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I should just make my way downstairs-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151353
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: What do we have here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151354
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't believe I've ever seen you around here before, what business
      do you have with the Companions?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151355
    - rid: 8164893287844151356
    - rid: 8164893287844151357
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: A-ah! I-I, uhh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I-I'm just N-natsuki's friend a-and she-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki's friend, eh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: A friend of hers is always welcome here, come on.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: E-eh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151358
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: We've got drinks to spare, have a few.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah-! I-I-I...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas leads Yuri toward an open space at the table.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela! Pass us a mead!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151359
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever, ice-brain.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela slides a mead toward Farkas, who passes it to Yuri.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: This stuff's my favorite, let me know if you want something else.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: A-ah...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I just wanted to go read...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (But, wouldn't it be rude to turn down a drink?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151360
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (They only gave me a drink after I told them I was Natsuki's friend-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151361
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Which means this is probably some sort of social ritual to become officially
      acquainted...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uhh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151362
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri looks over the mead that Farkas gave her.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151363
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151364
    - rid: 8164893287844151365
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm just overthinking this, one drink won't hurt...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151366
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri takes a big swig of her mead.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151367
    - rid: 8164893287844151369
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! That was quite the big swig!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151368
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm... It's not bad.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151370
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: So, how'd you meet Natsuki?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: We actually met a few weeks ago...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893287844151371
